  User request: Crea un workflow que coja los emails que recibo y los clasifique con ia por nivel de urgencia
  Workflow objective: User requested a new workflow for: Crea un workflow que coja los emails que recibo y los clasifique con ia por nivel de urgencia
  Desired outcome: Deliver an abstract workflow plan that satisfies: Crea un workflow que coja los emails que recibo y los clasifique con ia por nivel de urgencia
  Workflow summary: Design an abstract workflow that captures incoming emails, processes them through an AI model to classify urgency levels, and prepares the results for further action or review.
  Current stage id: stage_2
  Current stage name: AI Urgency Classification
  Stage purpose: Analyze each email using an AI model to determine its urgency level (e.g., low, medium, high).
  Stage required capabilities: Integration with an AI model capable of natural language processing and urgency classification., Ability to process emails in a batch or sequential manner based on volume.
  Stage expected inputs: Raw emails from the previous stage, including metadata.
  Stage expected outputs: A list of emails annotated with their respective urgency levels, along with any additional context or reasoning provided by the AI model.
  Stage dependencies: Stage 1: Email Collection
  Previous stage node selections: stage_1: n8n-nodes-base.emailSend
  Clarifications already provided:
  -
  Retrieval focus hint: Find the best standard n8n nodes for this stage.
