  Stage required capabilities: Ability to structure data based on urgency levels (e.g., low, medium, high)., Storage solution that supports retrieval and querying of classified emails.
  Stage expected inputs: Emails annotated with urgency levels from the previous stage.
  Stage expected outputs: A structured storage system containing emails categorized by urgency level., Optional: Additional metadata or tags for further filtering (e.g., sender, subject keywords).
  Stage dependencies: Stage 2: AI Urgency Classification
  Previous stage node selections: stage_1: n8n-nodes-base.emailSend | stage_2: n8n-nodes-base.code
