  Workflow objective: User requested a new workflow for: crea un workflow que clasifique los correos que vaya recibiendo con heurísticas por nivel de urgencia
  Desired outcome: Deliver an abstract workflow plan that satisfies: crea un workflow que clasifique los correos que vaya recibiendo con heurísticas por nivel de urgencia
  Workflow summary: Classify incoming emails with heuristic-based urgency levels
  Current stage id: stage2
  Current stage name: Heuristic-Based Urgency Classification
  Stage purpose: Apply heuristic rules to assign urgency levels (e.g., low, medium, high) based on email content and metadata.
  Stage required capabilities: Define and apply a set of heuristic rules for urgency classification (e.g., keywords, sender priority, deadlines)., Analyze email subject lines, body text, and metadata (e.g., sender reputation, time since receipt)., Score emails based on rule matches or patterns.
  Stage expected inputs: Structured email data from the previous stage.
  Stage expected outputs: Emails annotated with urgency levels and confidence scores., Optional: Justification for urgency classification (e.g., matched keywords, rules triggered).
  Stage dependencies: Stage1: Structured email data is required for analysis.
  Previous stage node selections: stage1: n8n-nodes-base.emailSend
  Clarifications already provided:
  -
  Retrieval focus hint: Find the best standard n8n nodes for this stage.
