rce_stage_id\":\"stage1\",\"target_stage_id\":\"stage2\",\"data_items\":[\"Raw emails with metadata\"],\"notes\":\"Data flows from receiving emails to AI classification in a linear, deterministic manner.\"}],\"assumptions\":[\"The user's email system supports real-time or scheduled retrieval of emails.\",\"An AI model for urgency classification is available or can be integrated.\",\"No manual intervention is required unless explicitly requested by the user.\"],\"missing_information\":[],\"handoff_notes\":[\"Preserve the distinction between receiving and processing emails.\",\"Ensure the AI classification stage adheres to the user's exact semantics for urgency levels (e.g., low, medium, high, critical).\",\"The workflow should avoid inventing additional stages unless explicitly requested by the user.\"],\"planning_ready\":true}", "event": "llm_output", "model": "mistralai/ministral-3-14b-reasoning", "request_id": "fcc588bae1", "stage": "multi_agent.product_manager.abstract_plan", "structured": true, "ts_utc": "2026-03-19T10:24:07.142334+00:00"}
