  ### Task: Generate 1-3 broad tags categorizing the main themes of the chat history, along with 1-3 more specific subtopic tags. ### Guidelines: - Start with high-level domains (e.g. Science, Technology, Philosophy, Arts, Politics, Business, Health, Sports, Entertainment, Education) - Consider including relevant subfields/subdomains if they are strongly represented throughout the conversation - If content is too short (less than 3 messages) or too diverse, use only ["General"] - Use the chat's primary language; default to English if multilingual - Prioritize accuracy over specificity ### Output: JSON format: { "tags": ["tag1", "tag2", "tag3"] } ### Chat History: <chat_history> USER: crea un workflow que vaya cogiendo los correos que recibo ylos clasifique con IA por nivel de urgencia ASSISTANT: {"entry_intent": "workflow_build_request", "target_stage": null, "confidence": 0.95, "routing_signals": ["Explicit request to create a new workflow ('crea un workflow')", "Action-oriented intent with clear functional need (classify emails by urgency)", "No mention of existing workflow or debugging/failure", "Solution-oriented phrasing without business discovery focus", "entered_product_manager_agent", "pm_use_case_derived_from_direct_build_request", "handoff_ready_architect", "entered_architect_agent"], "current_stage": "architect_agent", "missing_user_inputs": ["Workflow blueprint returned a connection to a non-existent node."], "consultant_query_analysis": null, "consultant_selected_sources": [], "consultant_tools_used": [], "consultant_used_retrieval": false, "consultant_retrieval_results": [], "consultant_response": null, "consultant_notes": [], "business_context_summary": null, "discovered_use_cases": [], "selected_use_case": null, "alternative_use_cases": [], "selection_reason": null, "architecture_plan": {"use_case_id": "direct_build_request", "title": "crea un workflow que vaya cogiendo los correos que recibo ylos clasifique con...", "business_objective": "User reque