  ### Task: Suggest 3-5 relevant follow-up questions or prompts that the user might naturally ask next in this conversation as a **user**, based on the chat history, to help continue or deepen the discussion. ### Guidelines: - Write all follow-up questions from the user’s point of view, directed to the assistant. - Make questions concise, clear, and directly related to the discussed topic(s). - Only suggest follow-ups that make sense given the chat content and do not repeat what was already covered. - If the conversation is very short or not specific, suggest more general (but relevant) follow-ups the user might ask. - Use the conversation's primary language; default to English if multilingual. - Response must be a JSON array of strings, no extra text or formatting. ### Output: JSON format: { "follow_ups": ["Question 1?", "Question 2?", "Question 3?"] } ### Chat History: <chat_history> USER: crea un workflow que vaya cogiendo los correos que recibo ylos clasifique con IA por nivel de urgencia ASSISTANT: {"entry_intent": "workflow_build_request", "target_stage": null, "confidence": 0.95, "routing_signals": ["Explicit request to create a new workflow ('crea un workflow')", "Action-oriented intent with clear functional need (email classification by urgency)", "No mention of existing workflow or debugging/failure context", "entered_product_manager_agent", "pm_use_case_derived_from_direct_build_request", "handoff_ready_architect", "entered_architect_agent"], "current_stage": "architect_agent", "missing_user_inputs": ["Which concrete system or trigger should start the stage 'Collect Incoming Emails'?"], "consultant_query_analysis": null, "consultant_selected_sources": [], "consultant_tools_used": [], "consultant_used_retrieval": false, "consultant_retrieval_results": [], "consultant_response": null, "consultant_notes": [], "business_context_summary": null, "discovered_use_cases": [], "selected_use_case": null, "alternative_use_cases": [], "selection_reason": null, "archit