2026-03-19 13:24:45,763 INFO n8n-assistant.trace: TRACE EVENT {"content_chars": 2228, "content_preview": "{\"workflow_summary\":\"A workflow that continuously receives incoming emails and classifies them by urgency level using AI.\",\"stages\":[{\"id\":\"stage1\",\"name\":\"Receive Incoming Emails\",\"purpose\":\"Continuously collect all incoming emails from the user's email source.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"Email reception\",\"Inbound processing\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"User's email account access\",\"Incoming emails\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"Stream of received emails\"],\"dependencies\":[],\"success_criteria\":[\"All incoming emails are captured without loss.\"],\"notes\":\"This stage must preserve the exact trigger style ('receiving') and source system context (e.g., Gmail if mentioned).\"},{\"id\":\"stage2\",\"name\":\"Classify Emails by Urgency Using AI\",\"purpose\":\"Analyze each received email to determine its urgency level using an AI model.\",\"required_capabilities\":[\"AI-based classification\",\"Urgency level determination\"],\"expected_inputs\":[\"Stream of received emails from Stage 1\"],\"expected_outputs\":[\"Emails with assigned urgency levels (e.g., Low, Medium, High)\"],\"dependencies\":[\"Stage 1 output\"],\"success_criteria\":[\"Each email is classified with a consistent and accurate urgency level.\"],\"notes\":\"The AI model should be trained or configured to interpret email content and context for urgency. No manual review or refinement unless explicitly requested.\"}],\"data_flow\":[{\"source_stage_id\":\"stage1\",\"target_stage_id\":\"stage2\",\"data_items\":[\"Received emails\"],\"notes\":\"Data flows from email reception to AI classification without intermediate steps unless specified.\"}],\"assumptions\":[\"The user's email source is a standard inbound system (e.g., Gmail).\",\"AI classification is deterministic and does not require external validation or feedback loops.\",\"No manual intervention is needed for classification unle