 selections: -\nClarifications already provided:\nQuestion: Should we consider adding text processing or NLP-specific nodes (e.g., for topic extraction, intent analysis) to the candidate pool for this stage?\nAnswer: los que describes están bien; low, medium, high y critical. solo text_based. solo tiene que asignarles un tag con el nivel de urgencia asignado. no hace falta almacenarlos en ningun lado\nRetrieval focus hint: Prefer exact inbound trigger or main-path action nodes that match the user wording. Reject send/respond nodes for intake and reject nodes with auxiliary AI connectors.", "request_id": "e0e4ac9f18", "result_count": 8, "stage": "multi_agent.architect.stage_search", "stage_id": "stage1", "top_rerank_confidence": 0.02878270720797502, "ts_utc": "2026-03-19T12:59:28.394974+00:00"}
