  User request: crea un workflow que vaya cogiendo los correos que recibo ylos clasifique con IA por nivel de urgencia
  Workflow objective: User requested a new workflow for: ### Task: Suggest 3-5 relevant follow-up questions or prompts that the user might naturally ask next in this conversation as a **user**,...
  Desired outcome: Deliver an abstract workflow plan that satisfies: ### Task: Suggest 3-5 relevant follow-up questions or prompts that the user might naturally ask next in this conversation as a **user**,...
  Workflow summary: Abstract workflow plan for suggesting relevant follow-up questions or prompts based on chat history to continue or deepen a discussion.
  Current stage id: stage1
  Current stage name: Analyze Chat History
  Stage purpose: Extract key topics, context, and user intent from the chat history to identify natural follow-up opportunities.
  Stage required capabilities: Understand conversational context, Identify relevant themes or topics in a discussion, Determine user intent or direction of the conversation
  Stage expected inputs: Chat history (transcript or log), Guidelines for generating follow-up questions (e.g., conciseness, relevance, no repetition)
  Stage expected outputs: List of identified key topics or themes, User intent or direction of the conversation, Potential gaps or areas to deepen the discussion
  Stage dependencies: -
  Previous stage node selections: -
  Clarifications already provided:
  Question: Should we consider adding text processing or NLP-specific nodes (e.g., for topic extraction, intent analysis) to the candidate pool for this stage?
