  Current stage name: Classify Emails by Urgency
  Stage purpose: Analyze each received email using AI to determine its urgency level (e.g., low, medium, high). The classification should be based on the content and context of the email.
  Stage required capabilities: AI-based text analysis for urgency classification, Natural language processing (NLP) for understanding email content
  Stage expected inputs: Raw emails with metadata from Stage 1
  Stage expected outputs: Emails annotated with an urgency level (e.g., low, medium, high)
  Stage dependencies: Stage 1: Receive Emails
  Previous stage node selections: stage1: n8n-nodes-base.cron
